## Technical Architecture Overview

| Layer | Component | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Input** | `cv2.VideoCapture` | Pulls 720p or 1080p raw feed from the webcam. |
| **Logic** | `threading` | To keep the UI responsive while the image is "processing" in the background. |
| **Styling** | `LUT (Look-Up Tables)` | To map modern RGB colors to vintage film tones (e.g., Agfa or Kodak presets). |
| **Output** | `Pillow.Image.save()` | Exports a high-res vertical `.png` or `.jpg` formatted for 4x6 photo paper. |

