## Pro-Tip 
To make this stand out in this project, don't just use a filter. Use a **CycleGAN**. You can train it on a dataset of "Modern Digital Photos" vs. "Scanned 1970s Polaroids." This way, your program isn't just adding a tint—it’s actually *reimagining* the photo as if it were taken 50 years ago.
